scope the mantra lane's seven delivery modules, one lock, one probe, one scan, one control, one witness, two READMEs, the card
status GREEN on the work -- seven selftests, mantra_snapshot_hosted, mantra_tablecloth_query_wire (with its concurrency leg), mantra_udp_reuseaddr, mantra_cli_record, shim_reason, prose_register, readme_metrics, geode_libraries, tame_style_check and width_check all green. HOT pass 260 run, 255 green, tree_moved=no; four of its five reds were mine and are repaired, and stash_record stands at unlanded=2, named rather than routed around.
recommend check-in (Claude) two killed laps of this seat are still boxed and a third was rediscovered rather than read -- whether a lap must read the dead-letter box before it takes work is a law question, not a mechanical one
